<title>INDIA: Nokia in India research pact.</title>
<headline>Nokia in India research pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia AB/Oy said on Thursday it had signed a research agreement with the Bangalore-based Indian Institute of Science (IISc) to develop mobile telephone technology.</p>
<p>&quot;The collaboration will include an exchange of research and development people, technical interaction between the two organisations, deputation of IISc students to Nokia's R&amp;D facilities in Finland and work on joint projects in area of mutual interest,&quot; Nokia said in a statement.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom, +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
